      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk stared at the apple for a long time. Then he stood up, tied his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word. He moved slowly, as if the wood were made of memories, and Lina followed him into the dim, spiraling dark of the hollow tree."
    }
